      },
      "blurb": "Systems Alliance professional combat marine",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Systems Alliance marines are the professional military backbone of humanity's presence in the galaxy. They train for conditions ranging from orbital insertion to ship-to-ship boarding, and their equipment reflects a military budget that few private organizations can match. When Alliance marines are deployed somewhere, the situation has escalated past the point where diplomacy was going to resolve it.</p><p><strong>Alliance Training:</strong> Can Interact to reload a weapon and Stride up to half speed as a single action.</p><p><strong>Suppressing Fire (2 actions):</strong> The marine saturates a 10-ft square within 60 ft with fire. Until the start of the marine's next turn, each creature that enters or begins its turn in the square must succeed at a DC 23 Reflex save or take 2d6+4 piercing damage and become flat-footed until the end of their next turn.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 80 Shield HP. Recharges 20 HP per turn.</p>",
